  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1139352.svg\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"169\" height=\"25\" /></p>\n<div><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-blue?style=plastic&amp;link=https%3A%2F%2Ffiles.minecraftforge.net%2Fnet%2Fminecraftforge%2Fforge%2F\" alt=\"靜態徽章\" /> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-lime?style=plastic&amp;link=https%3A%2F%2Fneoforged.net%2F\" alt=\"靜態徽章\" /> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-yellow?style=plastic&amp;link=https%3A%2F%2Ffabricmc.net%2F\" alt=\"靜態徽章\" /></div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">本模組為 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountiful\">Bountiful</a> 新增了更多賞金任務，以確保其能與其他模組相容。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/ExtraBounties/screen.png?raw=true\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"574\" height=\"260\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">若您希望協助本模組的開發，請查閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/DataThings/blob/Extra-Bounties/README.md\">README</a> 並提交 Pull Request！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">模組相容性建議請 <a href=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/DataThings/issues\">點擊此處</a> 提出</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-bounties/relations/dependencies\">查看所有已包含的模組清單</a></span></p>",
